# Tor configuration for th3-tor container
# Ascended33 OPSEC anonymity layer

# Network settings
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
ControlPort 9051

# Logging
Log notice stdout
Log warn stdout

# Performance
NumEntryGuards 3
KeepalivePeriod 300

# Security
SafeSocks 1
TestSocks 1

# Exit policy
ExitPolicy accept *:*

# Anonymity mode
StrictNodes 1
UseEntryGuards 1
EnforceDistinctSubnets 1
